sentences.l:
And him, far the first, saw Telemachus, godlike-in-form,
coming through the house, the swineherd, and quickly then
he nodded, calling him to himself;

and he, having looked about, took a stool
lying there, where the carver used to sit, much meat
dividing, for the suitors feasting throughout the house;

And close, after him, entered the house Odysseus,
to a beggar pitiful like, and an old man,
propping himself;

He spoke, and with both hands he received it and set it down
right there before his feet, upon the unseemly wallet,
and he was eating, while the minstrel in the halls was singing;

“Antinous, truly for me fairly, as a father for a son, you care,
you who the stranger bid from the hall to drive away
with a word of compulsion;
